<title>USA: Spartech Corp Q4 Nov 2 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Spartech Corp Q4 Nov 2 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	    Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>			 (Unaudited)			 (Audited)</p>
<p>		  Nov. 2, Oct. 28,    Pct  Nov. 2, Oct. 28,   Pct</p>
<p>		    1996     1995  Change   1996     1995  Change</p>
<p> Net Sales     $104,329 $86,475   21% $391,348 $352,273   11%</p>
<p>Operating Earnings</p>
<p>			9,185   6,180   49%   34,492   24,604   40%</p>
<p>Interest Expense</p>
<p>			1,485   1,181   26%    5,062    4,960    2%</p>
<p>Income Tax Provision</p>
<p>			2,964   1,360  118%   11,113    5,110  117%</p>
<p> Net Earnings     4,736   3,639   30%   18,317   14,534   26%</p>
<p>Fully Diluted Earnings Per Common Share*</p>
<p>			 0.18    0.15   20%     0.73     0.60   22%</p>
<p>		  (In Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>*All of the company's preferred stockholders converted their securities into common stock effective May 1, 1995, and therefore, only fully diluted earnings per common share are presented in this condensed statement of operations.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
